model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "A Worker's metadata hash covers each binding as the upload carries it. The dev-only `hyperdrives` channel a Hyperdrive binding contributes beside the wire binding, read only by local development, is left out: its origins come from the Hyperdrive's attributes, which an apply takes from what it reconciled and a later plan from the live read, so hashing them planned every Worker bound to a Hyperdrive as an update on every deploy. A change to the wire binding itself still changes the hash."
    }
  }
}
